<title>INDONESIA: Indonesia Cahaya Kalbar nine-mth net up.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Cahaya Kalbar nine-mth net up.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to September 30</p>
<p>			 (in billion rupiah unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net sales		    75.61 vs 17.01</p>
<p>    Gross profit		 18.03 vs  3.36</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   15.89 vs  2.43</p>
<p>    Net income		   13.82 vs  2.37</p>
<p>    Earnings per share (rph)   192 vs  593</p>
<p>    Retained earnings	  22.93 vs  7.97</p>
<p>Note: The consolidated results were unaudited. PT Cahaya Kalbar, listed last July, is a cocoa and edible oil maker.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom +6221 384-6364</p>
</text>
